            <div xml:id="d86">

                <pb facs="0340" n="196" xml:id="pg196"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.00B/597: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to the Minister in
                        China</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">MacMurray</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1929-06-14T15:00:00-04:00">June 14, 1929—3
                    p.m.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>195. Newspaper reports state that Soviets have been mobilizing forces on
                    Chinese-Siberian border. Can you confirm?</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Clark</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
